<https://w3id.org/probknow/resource/claim/morphoeval-carmona-neural-crest-chase-and-run> a pk:Claim ;
    rdfs:label "Carmona-Fontaine et al. (2008, 2011) & Theveneau et al. (2013) neural crest CIL, C3a co-attraction & Sdf1 chase-and-run migration (Xenopus laevis & Mus musculus vertebrate cranial neural crest streams and epibranchial placodes)",
        "Carmona-Fontaine et al. (2008, 2011) & Theveneau et al. (2013) neural crest CIL, C3a co-attraction & Sdf1 chase-and-run migration faithfully reproduces Xenopus laevis & Mus musculus vertebrate cranial neural crest streams and epibranchial placodes morphology" ;
    dct:conformsTo <https://w3id.org/probknow/resource/math-law/carmona-neural-crest-chase-and-run-1>,
