        <https://w3id.org/probknow/resource/math-law/carmona-neural-crest-chase-and-run-3> ;
    dct:description "The simulation script(s) 2012-carmona-neural-crest-chase-and-run.py implement the cited source model as published and produce forms that match real Xenopus laevis & Mus musculus vertebrate cranial neural crest streams and epibranchial placodes specimens and the source authors' figures. A belief under audit, not a fact: its credibility is the weight of evidence (MorphoEval 0.1.0 overall 55.0/100, audit 2026-10-19-neural-crest-chase-and-run-audit) and the assessments." ;
    dct:subject <https://github.com/fractastical/morpholib/blob/317bc3c/2012-carmona-neural-crest-chase-and-run.py> ;
    schema:about "Xenopus laevis & Mus musculus vertebrate cranial neural crest streams and epibranchial placodes" ;
