<https://w3id.org/probknow/resource/assessment/morphoeval-carmona-neural-crest-chase-and-run-code-traceability> a pk:LLMClaimAssessment ;
    rdfs:label "Carmona-Fontaine et al. (2008, 2011) & Theveneau et al. (2013) neural crest CIL, C3a co-attraction & Sdf1 chase-and-run migration — Code-to-model traceability: 68/100" ;
    dct:date "2026-10-19"^^xsd:date ;
    dct:description "Functions correspond to homotypic CIL/COA and heterotypic chase-and-run forces, and `morphoeval/lean/loops/Loop_091_neural_crest_chase_and_run.lean` proves 4 theorems, but v1 docstrings lack detailed mappings to Theveneau et al. (2013) Figs. 1-6, Carmona-Fontaine et al. (2011) Figs. 2-5, and Woods et al. (2014) Eqs. 1-6." ;
    dct:subject <https://w3id.org/probknow/resource/concept/morphoeval-0.1.0-code-traceability> ;
    pk:assessedBy <https://w3id.org/probknow/resource/model/gemini-4-argon> ;
