    pk:evidenceAgainst "2012-carmona-neural-crest-chase-and-run.py L29–L158: Baseline functions lack equation-by-equation citations to Woods et al. (2014) and Theveneau et al. (2013) <https://github.com/fractastical/morpholib/blob/317bc3c/2012-carmona-neural-crest-chase-and-run.py#L29-L158>" ;
    pk:hasEvidence <https://w3id.org/probknow/resource/evidence/morphoeval-carmona-neural-crest-chase-and-run-code-traceability-1> ;
