    pk:hasVerdict "mostly faithful" .

<https://w3id.org/probknow/resource/assessment/morphoeval-carmona-neural-crest-chase-and-run-model-fidelity> a pk:LLMClaimAssessment ;
    rdfs:label "Carmona-Fontaine et al. (2008, 2011) & Theveneau et al. (2013) neural crest CIL, C3a co-attraction & Sdf1 chase-and-run migration — Model fidelity to source: 68/100" ;
    dct:date "2026-10-19"^^xsd:date ;
    dct:description "Implements pairwise homotypic CIL repulsion and C3a/C3aR exponential co-attraction (`compute_cil_coa_pair_force`, L29-39) and 2D agent-based NC-placode chase-and-run dynamics (`simulate_chase_and_run_v1`, L42-158) with a placode-ablated negative control. However, v1 simulates only 2 of the 5 experimental regimes of Theveneau et al. (2013), omitting C3aR-MO COA ablation (`k_COA = 0`), N-cadherin/DshDep+ CIL blockade (`k_CIL = 0`), and the stationary Sdf1 bead control, and models only a single harmonic channel rather than the 3 cranial neural crest streams (`r4`, `r6`, `r7`) separated by pharyngeal pouches." ;
    dct:subject <https://w3id.org/probknow/resource/concept/morphoeval-0.1.0-model-fidelity> ;
    pk:assessedBy <https://w3id.org/probknow/resource/model/gemini-4-argon> ;
    pk:assessmentType "morphoeval/0.1.0/model-fidelity" ;
    pk:evidenceAgainst "2012-carmona-neural-crest-chase-and-run.py L42–L158: Simulates only WT chase-and-run and no-placode control in a single channel, omitting C3aR-MO, DshDep+ CIL blockade, stationary bead control, and 3-stream pharyngeal arch geometry <https://github.com/fractastical/morpholib/blob/317bc3c/2012-carmona-neural-crest-chase-and-run.py#L42-L158>" ;
    pk:hasEvidence <https://w3id.org/probknow/resource/evidence/morphoeval-carmona-neural-crest-chase-and-run-model-fidelity-1> ;
    pk:hasScore 6.8e-01 ;
    pk:hasVerdict "mostly faithful" .

<https://w3id.org/probknow/resource/assessment/morphoeval-carmona-neural-crest-chase-and-run-morphometric-validation> a pk:LLMClaimAssessment ;
    rdfs:label "Carmona-Fontaine et al. (2008, 2011) & Theveneau et al. (2013) neural crest CIL, C3a co-attraction & Sdf1 chase-and-run migration — Morphometric validation: 53/100" ;
    dct:date "2026-10-19"^^xsd:date ;
    dct:description "Computes 4 synthetic measurements in `measure_morphoeval()` (L215-250), but does not quantify cluster cohesion index `C_COA`, does not compare simulated vs empirical Forward Migration Index (`FMI`) and 6-hour displacement across the 5 regimes of Theveneau et al. (2013), and does not measure dorsoventral NC-to-placode separation or anteroposterior stream periodicity on `neural_crest_specimen.jpg`." ;
    dct:subject <https://w3id.org/probknow/resource/concept/morphoeval-0.1.0-morphometric-validation> ;
